{"resourceIdentifier":"2846","resourceName":"FSW AMMS GHG Mitigation Project in Nanyang City","description":"The project introduces new animal waste management systems (AWMSs) to treat the manure from 9 existing swine farms in Nanyang City, Henan Province. Each subsidiary swine farm will install one AWMS, and the manure is treated on site. The purpose of the project activity is to treat the manure and wastewater to avoid methane emissions generated in the baseline uncovered anaerobic lagoons. \r\nAll the manure and wastewater are collected and then be separated first. The solid will be treated in aerobic composting system and the organic fertilizers will be produced, part of the fertilizer produced in this process will be distributed to local farmers for free and the others will be sold in domestic market. The liquid will be treated through anaerobic digestion and the biogas generated during the treatment process will be captured and sent to boilers for heat generation and Surplus biogas will be destroyed through the flaring system (if any). The sludge produced from anaerobic digestion will be treated through aerobic composting together with the solid, the effluent will be supplied to the farmers living around free for agriculture irrigation.\r\nIt is estimated that approximately 1916 tons of animal manure will be handled daily by the AWMSs and 3,847.173*104m3 of biogas can be produced annually. Also, the generated heat through biogas will be only used for daily operation of the AWMS and the 9 swine farms themselves and will not be provided to other users. For conservativeness, baseline emissions from heat generation are neglected.","location":{"latitude":33.220000,"longitude":112.730000},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-03-09","endExclusive":"2022-04-09","endInclusive":"2022-04-08"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2846"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Muyuan Foods Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2846"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"364750"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Livestock, enteric fermentation, and manure management"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0010"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"29/09/2022"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 05/08/2020 - 04/08/2030"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=61803&IDKEY=0lksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098o85226337","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"PD-FSW AMMS GHG Mitigation Project in Nanyang City-V02-20220218-clean.docx","uploadDate":"2022-02-21T03:03:09.25Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=59480&IDKEY=s98klasmf8jflkasf8098afnasfkj98f0a9sfsakjflsakjf8ds82022920","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS Listing Reresentation.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-12-31T07:40:51.463Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=75056&IDKEY=0iquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkfk103502224","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Joint-Project-Description-Monitoring-Report-Mu